# Migration rules

- Always follow `docs/AGENTS.md` (injected every session via `.cursor/rules/agents.mdc`).
- Requirements SoT: `docs/Laravel_5.1_to_13_Modernization_Spec.md`. Execution roadmap: `docs/migration-plan.md` (must fully reflect the Spec).
- If the plan would omit or weaken a Spec requirement, the Spec wins — update the plan.
- Preserve business behavior; never silently fix suspected bugs — document, propose, wait.
- Layering: Controller (HTTP only) → Form Request → Policy/Gate → Service → Model → Job.
- Reference app at `/mnt/e/xampp/htdocs/airconcierge` is read-only; never copy secrets or the old tree here.
- Do not port modules or import `migrations_fresh` until that phase/step is approved.
- Phase 0–1 implemented; next is Phase 1a, then Phase 2+ per the migration plan.
- No new global helpers; no business logic in Blade; no `env()` outside config.
